  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/29",
  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">구글 드로잉을 이용해 사진 만화를 받았습니다.</p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">저는 중1 중력- 무게와 질량 파트에서 활용했어요 ^^</p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">간단한 방법이지만, 학생들 입장에서 계속 같은 형식의 퀴즈만 푸는게 지겨울 것 같아</p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">좀 더 재미있어할 만 하고, 스스로 생각을 할 수 있는 과제로 받아봤습니다.</p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">홀짝 등교하다보니 오프라인 수업에 온라인도 병행하게 되니 ㅜㅜ 어려움이 많습니다! ㅎㅎ</p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">다른 단원에 활용 하셔도 좋을 것 같습니다.</p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">수업 영상 제시 후,&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">과제 안내 ↓</span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99EEBE355EEF0C651F\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"ssss.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; cursor: pointer; max-width: 712px; clear: none; float: none;\" id=\"A_99EEBE355EEF0C651F970B\" id=\"A_99EEBE355EEF0C651F970B\"/></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">구글 드로잉 과제 링크 제시</p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/1fb9P0zMr1eD1qw6xkJ3poEwdCNIUleilmTlaJq96baE/edit?usp=sharing</span><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">아래는 학생들에게 받은 작품입니다 ^^</span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">귀여운 과제들이 많네요 ㅎㅎ!</span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E187355EEF0D4A1D\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"7.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; cursor: pointer; max-width: 712px; clear: none; float: none;\" id=\"A_99E187355EEF0D4A1DE9EF\" id=\"A_99E187355EEF0D4A1DE9EF\"/></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999CEB355EEF0D4B20\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"1.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; cursor: pointer; max-width: 712px; clear: none; float: none;\" id=\"A_999CEB355EEF0D4B20BE2E\" id=\"A_999CEB355EEF0D4B20BE2E\"/></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99DA83355EEF0D461E\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; cursor: pointer; max-width: 712px; clear: none; float: none;\" id=\"A_99DA83355EEF0D461E3550\" id=\"A_99DA83355EEF0D461E3550\"/></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B4843A5EEF0E9B1C\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"4.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; cursor: pointer; max-width: 712px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199); clear: none; float: none;\" id=\"A_99B4843A5EEF0E9B1C3D4D\" id=\"A_99B4843A5EEF0E9B1C3D4D\"/><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99DECE355EEF0D481E\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"5.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; cursor: pointer; max-width: 712px; clear: none; float: none;\" id=\"A_99DECE355EEF0D481E31D8\" id=\"A_99DECE355EEF0D481E31D8\"/></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99EE3B355EEF0D4920\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"6.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; cursor: pointer; max-width: 712px; clear: none; float: none;\" id=\"A_99EE3B355EEF0D49209933\" id=\"A_99EE3B355EEF0D49209933\"/></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D160355EEF0D471E\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"3.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; cursor: pointer; max-width: 712px; font-size: 10pt; clear: none; float: none;\" id=\"A_99D160355EEF0D471ED58A\" id=\"A_99D160355EEF0D471ED58A\"/></p></div><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b><br></b></span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b><br></b></span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b><br></b></span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b>&lt;&lt;추가&gt;&gt;</b></span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b>**구글 클래스룸을 사용하는 학교에서 제일 효과적으로 운영할 수 있을 것 같아요**</b></span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;그렇지 않은 경우, 피피티 틀 한장을 만들어서 첨부로 올려주고 학생들이 다운받아 다시 제출하는 형식이 그나마 비슷할 듯 합니다. 다른 플랫폼을 써보지 못해 모르겠어요 ㅜㅜ&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">구글의 경우, 제가 구글 드로잉 파일 만든 후, 과제 낼 때 '사본으로 제공'으로 하면, 학생 1~33번 까지 개별 학생이 수정할 수 있는 파일이 다 생성이 되고, 학생이 자기 파일에 바로 입력하면 자동 저장됩니다. 그 후 '제출하기' 버튼을 누르면 제가 구글 클래스에서 과제를 확인할 수 있어요.(따로 메일 보내거나 첨부</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">할 필요 없음)</span></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">* 과제보기 클릭</p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9992544A5EF0410C06\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"학생1.jpg\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_9992544A5EF0410C06092B\"/></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">↓</span></b></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">*설문지도 하고, 내과제에 생성된 드로잉 과제도 하기. 둘 다 한 후 제출 누르면 교사가 확인가능</span></b></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D8434B5EF0411B06\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"700\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"700\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"학생2.jpg\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_99D8434B5EF0411B06F533\"/></p><div><br></div><p><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&lt;&lt;구글 클래스룸 안쓰는 경우 &gt;&gt;</span></b></p><p>https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1Jbpbb0j29X-X1IuT3mYADfH7sCbHdb-WqCYe8jy-HwQ/edit#slide=id.g89584b093e_0_14<br></p><p>이런식으로 구글 드라이브에 프리젠테이션 반별로 만든 후 반별로 각각 링크를 공유하여 갤러리에 받는 방법이 있습니다만,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">지금이 문서는 링크 가진 누구나 편집 가능이라서, 다른 학생이 만든걸 누가 지워도 알 길이 없습니다. 즉.. 좋은 방법이 아니네요 ^^;;</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}